      "comment": "HELLO PRETZEL (7) is a fast dog well performed over the sprint races. Was too tough when scoring last time over 388m at this track in a Grade 5 (22.21). Strike rate this course and distance strong having won three of six tries. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Looks the one to beat. TILLY TIPPETT (1) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing seventh (23.44) in a Grade 4 at this track. The form out of her last race has been franked. Expected to run well. LAKOTA COURTNEY (5) missed the frame latest (30.53) when fifth over 515m at this track in a Grade 5. Fairly consistent record from the draw including a win and six minors. Must respect.",
